Description Graphene Kubo (Lanczos recursion) density of states
Prefix generate

TypeOfSystem Graphene
TB.Hopping 3.1

CellSize 1
SuperCell 300

Kubo.Calc .true.
Diag.Calc .false.
Calculate.OnlyDOS .true.

RecursionNumber 200
NumberofEnergyPoints 201
Epsilon 0.05
EnergyMin 0-9.0
EnergyMax 9.0

# Reproducible random-phase state (the default seed is taken from the clock)
setSeed .true.
seedValue 123456

TB.NeighLevels 1

WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
